## STANDING EXECUTION CONSTRAINTS
1. **OPERATIONAL DISCIPLINE (CEPAT, CERMAT, TEPAT, AKURAT)**: Every user instruction must be executed directly, meticulously reviewing dependencies, precisely fulfilling intent, and accurately verified (100% green tests) (`AGENTS.md` §0.2 & `agent-workflow.md` §0).
2. **NO GIT COMMIT / PUSH AUTONOMOUSLY**: Never commit or push without explicit user command (`AGENTS.md` §0.1 & `agent-workflow.md` §1.1).
3. **STRICT UTF-8 & NO POWERSHELL FILE EDITING**: Never use PowerShell cmdlets (`Set-Content`, `Get-Content`, `-replace`) to modify files. Use native tools (`edit_file`, `write_file`) or Node.js (`fs.*FileSync`) (`AGENTS.md` §0.1).
4. **WINDOWS CLI STANDARD**: Always invoke `npm.cmd` or direct `node` with `WaitMsBeforeAsync: 8000–10000` to avoid PowerShell script execution blocks and background task drops (`agent-workflow.md` §5.2).
5. **MINIMAL SUPABASE FOOTPRINT**: Ultra-lean queries (no broad `select('*')`), no raw blob ingestion in polling, client-side SVG/Canvas image processing, and in-memory reference caching (`AGENTS.md` §2.26 & `AGENTS.md` §0.1).
6. **SURGICAL & ATOMIC EDITS**: Single-pass table updates, direct component targeting (no unbounded grep sprees), fast-track test execution (`npm run test:fast`, `npm run test:table`), and no ceremonial `/plan` files for trivial UI edits (`agent-workflow.md` §2 & §4).
7. **STUDENT NAME & DASHBOARD/RESULT TITLE**: Standard authentic student name (`studentName`) everywhere across system; `Mr.` and `Miss` (and `King`/`Queen`) titles presented exclusively on Student Dashboard & Result Page (`AGENTS.md` §2.23 & `.agents/rules/ui-invariants.md` §2.8).
8. **DUMMY ACCOUNT & AVATAR COMPACTION**: Canonical dummy name strictly "Top"; ultra-compact SVG data URIs (~500 bytes) with zero-egress storage (`AGENTS.md` §2.24 & §2.25).
9. **ZERO-TRUNCATION & MASTER EDIT GRIDLINES**: Table cells and headers zero-truncation; white Excel gridlines in Master Edit Mode (`AGENTS.md` §2.21, §2.22 & `.agents/rules/ui-invariants.md` §4.2, §4.3).
10. **STRICT ZERO-MOVEMENT HOVER & GHOST-TO-SOLID MATTE BUTTONS**: Stationary button hover (`transform: none !important;` clean matte elevation shadow only, zero neon glow) to prevent top-border clipping; standby ghost outline vs active solid fill (`.agents/rules/ui-invariants.md` §3.4).
11. **SPATIAL & UNIVERSAL TABLE INVARIANTS**: Single-screen 100vh lock, 10px container gap, 40px Sub Panel, 60px Title Area & CTA Area, universal zero-truncation (calibrated column widths), Centered Loading states, and crisp white Excel gridlines in Master Edit Mode (`.agents/rules/ui-invariants.md`).
12. **UNIVERSAL DESIGN SYSTEM & TYPOGRAPHY GOVERNANCE**: Dual-scale Typography architecture (20px-16px-12px), zero sub-12px, zero emojis, Single Product Accent `#38bdf8` dengan teks gelap `#090d16` pada tombol solid (`DECISION-087`), unifikasi 4 warna (`#00c000`, `#ffff00`, `#ff0000`, `#a855f7` per `DECISION-086`), dan universal single-source color propagation protocol (SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH COLORING) (`AGENTS.md` §2.10 & `.agents/rules/ui-invariants.md` Bab 2 & Bab 3).
13. **STRICT ZERO UNSOLICITED ACTION INVARIANT (NO UNREQUESTED CHANGES)**: Never generate, create, modify, or delete any files, code, UI components, configs, or features that were NOT explicitly requested by the user. Maintain surgical focus strictly on the specified instruction (`AGENTS.md` §0.3 & `agent-workflow.md` §2.2).
14. **ZERO TABLE CAPSULE & ZERO TABLE GLOW (SSOT)**: Seluruh sel tabel bebas kapsul, pill, badge, border kotak kapsul, dan background fill (status semantik hanya warna font teks); mutlak nol glow, text-shadow, atau box-shadow; sel tabel (`td`) wajib memiliki garis pembatas kisi adaptif per tema (Adaptive Dual-Layer Gridlines) (`AGENTS.md` §2.31, §2.39 & `.agents/rules/ui-invariants.md` §4.9, §4.13).
15. **CLASS CODE STANDARD FORMULA (PROGRAM-LEVELCLASS)**: Formula baku `PROGRAM-LEVELCLASS` (contoh: `CAMP-3VOCAB`, `CAMP-1BASIC`, `EVNK-VOCAB` — segmen level ditiadakan pada program Non-Level per Zero-Level Omission Invariant), angka level murni digabung langsung dengan singkatan kelas tanpa spasi dan tanpa huruf 'L' (`AGENTS.md` §2.5.1 & `.agents/rules/ui-invariants.md` §4.10).
16. **TEST CODE & 2-LINE TEST TITLE ARCHITECTURE (SSOT)**: 4-blok simetris SKU mesin `PROGRAM-LEVEL_CLASS-CODE-TYPE` (contoh: `CAMP-3VCB-A1-TASK`, `CAMP-3VCB-D-EXAM`); judul tes siswa berformat 2 baris via `formatTestDisplay()`: Baris 1 `[TASK/EXAM] [CODE]` (Zero Class Redundancy, contoh: `Task A1`, `Exam D`), Baris 2 `[NAMA TOPIK/TEMA]` (`AGENTS.md` §2.6 & `.agents/rules/ui-invariants.md` §5.4).
17. **LEVEL PROMOTION & PASSING THRESHOLD INVARIANT**: Kelayakan kenaikan level merujuk resmi ke skor $\ge 60\%$ (**Grade D — Enough** pada CEC / **Grade C — Enough** pada TOP; khusus Ujian Akhir Tema Level 3 $\ge 70\%$ per `DECISION-084`), Grade F (dispensasi), atau Grade R (remedial); mutlak nol angka ambang arbitrer di luar SSOT; promosi level bersamaan tanpa meninggalkan siswa yang telah lulus (`AGENTS.md` §2.4.1 & `.agents/rules/ui-invariants.md` §6.4).
18. **TUTOR DESK 40PX SWITCHER DOCK, 30PX BOTTOM LEVEL BAR & SPREADSHEET SCORE MATRIX**: Bilah switcher dock dikunci mutlak 40px (`.tutor-master-dock` / `height: 40px !important;`) di semua area; bilah pemilih level berada di bawah di atas switcher dock dikunci mutlak 30px (`.tutor-bottom-level-bar` / `height: 30px !important;`); input nilai manual di seluruh kelas (Vocab, Speaking, Story, Grammar, Basic, dsb.) wajib berformat spreadsheet grid cell murni tanpa floating capsule box (`border: none !important; border-radius: 0 !important; background: transparent !important;` dengan outline fokus Excel) (`AGENTS.md` §2.40 & `.agents/rules/ui-invariants.md` §6.9).
19. **RESULT PAGE UNIFIED STUDENT ARCHITECTURE (`result.html` SSOT)**: Satu tampilan terpadu versi siswa saja (versi admin, segmen `NORMAL|REMEDIAL|FORGIVE`, grade `R`/`F`, & `BACK TO ROOM` dibuang); urutan kartu wajib **Student Identity Card (`#result-identity-card`) di atas Exam Title Card (`#result-Test-name-container`)**; judul tes 2 baris autentik bebas uppercase/truncation (`3rd Vocabulary Task B1` `#F8FAFC` / Topic `#38bdf8`); title `Mr.`/`Miss` & `King`/`Queen` seragam dengan Dashboard; single 10px mobile perimeter, matte non-neon, bottom banner terpusat, dan CEC Camp tetap `3RD STEP` (`AGENTS.md` §2.41 & `.agents/rules/ui-invariants.md` §5.6).
